  "title": "Cobb Vanth on Patrol",
  "description": "As the sheriff of Mos Pelgo — newly renamed Freetown — Cobb Vanth owes it to the people in his protection to keep the town and surrounding desert areas free of crime. When he's out on patrol one day, he finds the Pyke Syndicate making a deal for spice. This is displeasing to him, and he threatens them. He's going to let them go as long as they leave their spice, but if he ever catches them trading it in his territory again, they're going to pay with a lot more than the spice."
